0..71 Comment "// The steps of normalisation by evaluation for the simply typed lambda"
72..115 Comment "// calculus that the checker refuses today."
116..118 Comment "//"
119..196 Comment "// The evaluator, `nf` and the evaluation model need every step. Each refusal"
197..270 Comment "// names the unit that removes it, so the rung waits on those units only."
271..273 Comment "//"
274..346 Comment "// Each declaration is the smallest step of the evaluator that meets one"
347..419 Comment "// refusal. The model source declares the syntax and the semantic types."
